    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86354" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πρίᾰμος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῐ]</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>priam,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.19
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				Aeol.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πέρρᾰμος</span></b>  (wh. 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βασιλεύς</span>
			, acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>) <i><span class="en">
				Alc.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				8.2
			</span></i>; also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πέρᾰμος</span></b> ,
				<i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				20a
			</span></i>. <i><span class="en">
				16
			</span></i>:—Patron. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πριᾰμίδης</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[Πρῑ-</span> metri gr.], ὁ, 
				Ep.
			 gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίδαο, -ίδεω,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.356
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				20.77
			</span></i>: Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πριαμικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			<i>of</i> or <i>like Priam,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύχαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1101a8
				</span></i>
			; poet. fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πριαμίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1158
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Or.</u>
				1482
			</span></i> (lyr.): 
				Dim.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πριαμιλλύδριον</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πριαμύλλιον</span></b> , τό, Sch.D.T.<i><span class="en">
				pp.375,376
			</span></i> H.</div>
